 if(tslug==='playlist-safety-checker')body='<div class="tool-shell"><div class="detail-card"><h2>Playlist safety signals.</h2><p>This does not label a playlist fake or safe. It shows the evidence CuratorOS actually has.</p><div class="field"><label>Known CuratorOS playlist</label><select id="safety-playlist"><option value="">Choose…</option>'+ps.map(p=>'<option value="'+esc(p.slug)+'">'+esc(p.canonical_name)+'</option>').join('')+'</select></div></div><aside class="tool-result" id="safety-result"><h3>Evidence, not verdicts.</h3><p>No single signal proves bot activity. Unknown data remains unknown.</p></aside></div>';
